{"org":"elastic","repo":"elasticsearch","prNumber":"111475","commit":"57412f5012133f9b0f255452598979303a0cb591","generatedCommentsNodes":[{"comment":"The transition from `AttributeMap\u003cExpression\u003e` to `ArrayList\u003cAttribute\u003e` for the `resolved` collection changes the behavior regarding duplicate attributes. While `AttributeMap` (via its `keySet`) ensured uniqueness, `ArrayList` allows duplicates if multiple expressions in `groupings` resolve to the same `Attribute`. If `NamedExpressions.mergeOutputAttributes` does not handle duplicates, this could lead to redundant entries in the resulting attribute list.","nodes":[{"id":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/analysis/Analyzer.java-x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/analysis/Analyzer.java-22539:22575,22595:22607,22608:22618,22635:22647,22848:22873,23000:23034-22413:22516,22536:22545,22546:22555,22572:22581,22782:22801,22928:22936","promptId":"#0X6BJ","srcPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/analysis/Analyzer.java","dstPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/analysis/Analyzer.java","srcChanges":[{"pos":22539,"endPos":22575,"startLine":461,"startLineOffset":16,"endLine":461,"endLineOffset":52,"length":37},{"pos":22595,"endPos":22607,"startLine":462,"startLineOffset":16,"endLine":462,"endLineOffset":28,"length":13},{"pos":22608,"endPos":22618,"startLine":462,"startLineOffset":29,"endLine":462,"endLineOffset":39,"length":11},{"pos":22635,"endPos":22647,"startLine":462,"startLineOffset":56,"endLine":462,"endLineOffset":68,"length":13},{"pos":22848,"endPos":22873,"startLine":466,"startLineOffset":24,"endLine":466,"endLineOffset":49,"length":26},{"pos":23000,"endPos":23034,"startLine":469,"startLineOffset":86,"endLine":469,"endLineOffset":120,"length":35}],"dstChanges":[{"pos":22413,"endPos":22516,"startLine":459,"startLineOffset":16,"endLine":459,"endLineOffset":119,"length":104},{"pos":22536,"e